# Push destinations

When the user says "push":

1. Stay on the local branch `ebuka`. Do not rename it to `main`.
2. Keep `origin` as `https://github.com/Weblanedev/valuebridge.git`.
3. Keep a second remote named `valuebridgenew` at `https://github.com/ebuka-kora/valuebridgenew.git`. Add it if it is missing. Do not replace `origin`.
4. If there are uncommitted project changes, commit them, then push only the `ebuka` branch in both places:
   - `git push origin HEAD:ebuka`
   - `git push valuebridgenew HEAD:ebuka`
5. Do not push to `main` on `valuebridgenew`.
6. Do not add a placeholder README or use the message "first commit" for later pushes.
